message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "The Crossley Criteria: A Mathematical Proof of the Riemann Hypothesis, Verified in Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: Crossley
    given-names: Lee
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2264-2219"
type: software
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24466908"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
abstract: "A proof of the Riemann hypothesis, checked in Lean 4 against Mathlib's statement RiemannHypothesis. A theta-lift window for the prime-power ramp, from Levent Alpöge's geometric construction as specialised by David Sanftenberg and Lee Crossley, is turned into the absence of zeros by a Landau theorem proved from Mathlib alone, and the functional equation completes the proof."
